    "detailed_description": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Overview</h2></strong><br>In Woods is a roguelike survival game set in a forest. Fight different monsters, craft items, and defeat the final boss for victory.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2></strong><br><strong>Fight against Monsters</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113770/extras/2632ff88f70e05c93a6c70728f39f375.poster.avif?t=1754326548\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113770/extras/2632ff88f70e05c93a6c70728f39f375.webm?t=1754326548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113770/extras/2632ff88f70e05c93a6c70728f39f375.mp4?t=1754326548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>In each game, you'll face numerous attacking monsters. Fight against them and survive for as long as possible.<br><br><strong>Power Up the Character</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113770/extras/ed8953bc0016535e32397c70a8441c30.poster.avif?t=1754326548\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113770/extras/ed8953bc0016535e32397c70a8441c30.webm?t=1754326548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113770/extras/ed8953bc0016535e32397c70a8441c30.mp4?t=1754326548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>As you defeat a certain number of monsters, your character will level up and have the opportunity to choose a magic item.<br><br><strong>Craft Items</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113770/extras/a8646e4658a60da8200c716b240b924b.poster.avif?t=1754326548\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113770/extras/a8646e4658a60da8200c716b240b924b.webm?t=1754326548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113770/extras/a8646e4658a60da8200c716b240b924b.mp4?t=1754326548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You also have the ability to craft items with woods.<br><br><strong>Defeat the Final Boss</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113770/extras/92326806798a1ea5a05edcc2186f366c.poster.avif?t=1754326548\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113770/extras/92326806798a1ea5a05edcc2186f366c.webm?t=1754326548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113770/extras/92326806798a1ea5a05edcc2186f366c.mp4?t=1754326548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Survive for a specific duration and face the final boss and claim victory by defeating it.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Overview</h2></strong><br>In Woods is a roguelike survival game set in a forest. Fight different monsters, craft items, and defeat the final boss for victory.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2></strong><br><strong>Fight against Monsters</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113770/extras/2632ff88f70e05c93a6c70728f39f375.poster.avif?t=1754326548\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113770/extras/2632ff88f70e05c93a6c70728f39f375.webm?t=1754326548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113770/extras/2632ff88f70e05c93a6c70728f39f375.mp4?t=1754326548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>In each game, you'll face numerous attacking monsters. Fight against them and survive for as long as possible.<br><br><strong>Power Up the Character</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113770/extras/ed8953bc0016535e32397c70a8441c30.poster.avif?t=1754326548\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113770/extras/ed8953bc0016535e32397c70a8441c30.webm?t=1754326548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113770/extras/ed8953bc0016535e32397c70a8441c30.mp4?t=1754326548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>As you defeat a certain number of monsters, your character will level up and have the opportunity to choose a magic item.<br><br><strong>Craft Items</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113770/extras/a8646e4658a60da8200c716b240b924b.poster.avif?t=1754326548\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113770/extras/a8646e4658a60da8200c716b240b924b.webm?t=1754326548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113770/extras/a8646e4658a60da8200c716b240b924b.mp4?t=1754326548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You also have the ability to craft items with woods.<br><br><strong>Defeat the Final Boss</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113770/extras/92326806798a1ea5a05edcc2186f366c.poster.avif?t=1754326548\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113770/extras/92326806798a1ea5a05edcc2186f366c.webm?t=1754326548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2113770/extras/92326806798a1ea5a05edcc2186f366c.mp4?t=1754326548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Survive for a specific duration and face the final boss and claim victory by defeating it.",
